Starter Template
Copy this entire block into your index.html. Replace the placeholder text with your own content.
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
  &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Evidence Package — Your Name&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;style&gt;
    :root {
      --ink: #1a1a1a;
      --muted: #555;
      --border: #ddd;
      --bg: #fff;
      --accent: #2563eb;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
                   "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }
    h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    p, li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    a { color: var(--accent); }
    .tools { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem; background: #f7f7f7; border-radius: 6px; }
    .tools h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    footer { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;

  &lt;h1&gt;Project Title&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;p class="subtitle"&gt;Your Name · ARCH7476 · Semester 2026–27&lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;Decision Context&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
    What design decision is at stake? What alternatives exist?
    Why does evidence matter here rather than intuition alone?
  &lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;Evidence Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
    What evidence did you gather? Where did it come from?
    Which sources carried the most weight and why?
  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Source 1 — what it told you&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Source 2 — what it told you&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Source 3 — what it told you&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;Methodology&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
    What pathway did you choose (spreadsheet / GIS / Python)?
    What was your workflow? What tools, data, and steps?
  &lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;Key Findings&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
    What did the analysis reveal? What changed compared
    to your initial assumptions? Include figures if you have them.
  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;!-- To add an image: &lt;img src="figure1.png" alt="Description" style="max-width:100%;"&gt; --&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;Recommendation&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
    Given the evidence, what do you recommend — and under what conditions?
    What confidence level is appropriate?
  &lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;Limitations&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
    What assumptions did you make? What data was missing?
    What would you check next if you had more time?
  &lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;div class="tools"&gt;
    &lt;h3&gt;Interactive Tools&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
      &lt;a href="gis-explorer.html"&gt;GIS Site Explorer&lt;/a&gt; —
      explore the spatial analysis interactively.
    &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;footer&gt;
    ARCH7476: Evidence-Based Generative Design · The University of Hong Kong
  &lt;/footer&gt;

&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
A standalone copy of this template is also available at site_tools/portfolio-template.html in the course repository — download it directly if you prefer.
